# The functions of Mission_TalkToBoss in level press (the script levels/press/scripts/mission_talktoboss.py of data01.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: InitStatus, AfterBrowseNPC, SetBossSpeech, CreateHuman, Init, HideHumanIntoBureau, CreateSceneLaunchers, LaunchScene, EndOfScene, LoadScene, OnPossession, OnExitConversor, CheckMaxDist, CheckHumanDist, GoTalkToBoss, BossSpeech, SetNextMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/press/mission_talktoboss.def replaces this file.
section PreGoTalkToBoss
